  "description": "Find out what it costs to move a .NET Framework solution to modern .NET. The report names what blocks the migration, sizes each item in engineer-days, and grades how far to trust each finding. It runs with no network, no account, and no source code leaving your machine. One scan prices both options: stay on Windows, or go cross-platform.",
